{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“统整了大家的情报后，妈妈喵所在的地点……”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1624", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这附近吗……相当高的地方呢。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1625", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结姬女子学园的西北边是一片宽阔的丘陵地带。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "附近人烟稀少，是没有进行过土地开发的地区。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要侧耳倾听，就能听到虫鸣鸟叫。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉自己也成为大自然的一部份。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对动物们来说，是无法取代的珍贵栖息地。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“距离学校有点距离呢……”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4477", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从崖坡上可以一览整个旧市街。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也看得见远处的结女校舍。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，大家的情报是正确的吗？”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然了！因为安洁在学校的后园发现妈妈喵之后，就一直跟着它！”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "ag3461", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟樱乃是迷路到这里来，偶然看见的。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一如计划。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "sk1340", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个时候，结果还是我去接她们回来了……", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也在家附近看到它往这个方向逃走了，所以可能性很高。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1626", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结论就是这样，该怎么做呢？”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2166", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的视线都集中到美羽学姐身上。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，学姐点点头正要开口的时候。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "？？？", "alt_speaker_idx": 307, "voice": "mp0000", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2167", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不可能听错的那个特殊叫声。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“刚、刚才那个……”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘘！安静一点。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1627", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "sk1341", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们屏气凝神。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，在森林的深处看见一个小小的身影。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵妈妈", "alt_speaker_idx": 292, "voice": "mp0001", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "子ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜噜！”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "小熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "kp0000", "char_id": "子ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……出现了。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4480", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会错的，是妈妈喵。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1628", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也有小只的。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "sk1342", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "亲子的花纹不一样呢。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好可爱喔……让安洁好想带回家里去～”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "ag3462", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，我觉得不会错了。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2168", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“几年前跟小纱凪看见的，小熊喵的妈妈……”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2169", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这下就确定了。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵的母亲还活着，而且生活在这片森林里。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以这里……就是熊喵该回去的地方。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，先走远一点别吓到它们吧。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，这里不是人类可以践踏的地方。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1629", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么时候要把熊喵带来？”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4481", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁觉得越快越好。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "ag3463", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“社长，请做决定。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "sk1343", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2170", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐再次点点头看着我们。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天，就把小熊喵带来这里。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2171", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等小熊喵回到妈妈的身边后……大家就把这个地方忘记。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2172", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请绝对不要再来到这里。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2173", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，毕竟希望这里是能让动物们安心生活的场所……”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4482", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "sk1344", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要跟熊喵小姐分开，安洁好寂寞……”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "ag3464", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1630", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，熊喵需要一个能回去的地方。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1631", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“它不能一直跟总有一天会毕业离开的我们在一起。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1632", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是……”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ar4483", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁不能这么消沉呢！因为熊喵小姐能跟妈妈喵重逢了！”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": "ag3465", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2174", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……美羽学姐。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1633", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯。怎么了，小纱凪？”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2175", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1634", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，什么都没有。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1635", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "mu2176", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，纱凪？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1636", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在探路的回程中，纱凪一个人渐渐落后。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“走累了吗？”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我的职责就到这里了。”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1637", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你懂的吧？美羽学姐对熊喵……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1638", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说到一半，纱凪咬住下唇。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她这段时间以来总是很积极寻找熊喵的母亲。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我后来也注意到了那并不是她的本意。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接下来就交给你了。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1639", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然美羽学姐没有说出口，但她内心一定是不想跟熊喵分开的。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了让她不用去找熊喵的母亲，纱凪才会这么努力。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉……要领导其他人好累喔。我还是一个人行动比较轻松。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1640", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，让纱凪你辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 286, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1641", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这些温柔的话搞错对象了，笨蛋。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "sn1642", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪拍拍我的背，然后继续向前走。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_27.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她递来的接力棒，我必续确实传递下去才行。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
